WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Pointing Poker turns a focused refinement queue into a fast team decision.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.900
Use JQL to choose only the tickets that belong in this session, not the whole backlog.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.900
The ticket creator presents from the tribune by default.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.600
If they are absent, anyone can click “I’ll present it.”

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.200
Vote privately and watch the other avatars vote too.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.400
Reveal together, compare the spread, discuss assumptions, and accept the agreed estimate.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.200
Pointing Poker writes the story points to Jira, while History preserves the result.
